  "limits": "Resources are checked by res:// path only; uid-only references are not resolved. Property values are scanned for ExtResource and SubResource references but not type-checked. Signals and methods named by connections are not checked. Nodes inside instanced scenes are found by parsing those scenes (eight levels deep at most). Godot 3 scenes (format 2) are parsed with a warning, because Godot 4.7 converts their class names on load.",
  "related": [
    "asset_path_portability_checker",
